I just thought of something.


01:02:00.595 --> 01:02:02.116
Jen.


01:02:02.396 --> 01:02:03.558
Jen, you're the girl for me.


01:02:03.637 --> 01:02:05.840
You don't know me.
But you make me so happy.


01:02:05.920 --> 01:02:08.763
I tried to call you before,
but I lost my nerve.


01:02:08.962 --> 01:02:11.485
I used my imagination.


01:02:11.686 --> 01:02:14.169
But I was disturbed.


01:02:14.648 --> 01:02:17.652
Jenny, I got your number.


01:02:17.852 --> 01:02:20.696
I need to make you mine.


01:02:20.896 --> 01:02:24.018
Jenny, dont change your number,


01:02:24.098 --> 01:02:27.141
..8-6-7-5-3-0-9....


01:02:27.261 --> 01:02:30.105
..8-6-7-5-3-0-9....


01:02:31.505 --> 01:02:34.750
..8-6-7-5-3-0-9....


01:02:42.118 --> 01:02:44.038
They killed you.
- Oops!


01:02:44.238 --> 01:02:45.881
I'm still here, aren't I?


01:02:46.161 --> 01:02:48.883
I mean, they did go Benihana
on my ass with that knife.


01:02:48.963 --> 01:02:50.766
And it should have killed me but...


01:02:50.967 --> 01:02:52.728
..for some reason...


01:02:52.927 --> 01:02:54.449
..it didn't.


01:02:56.411 --> 01:02:58.053
Maybe it did.


01:03:24.040 --> 01:03:26.482
Anyway, I don't really remember
what happened after that.


01:03:26.562 --> 01:03:29.164
I just know that I woke up and...


01:03:29.365 --> 01:03:31.687
..I found my way back to you.


01:03:43.378 --> 01:03:45.020
I remember.


01:03:45.941 --> 01:03:48.144
I couldn't bring myself to hurt you.


01:03:48.344 --> 01:03:50.667
I mean, I'm a really good friend.


01:03:51.468 --> 01:03:54.190
I was just so hungry.


01:04:12.849 --> 01:04:14.371
Ahmet!


01:04:15.811 --> 01:04:17.453
You made it out?


01:04:21.417 --> 01:04:23.060
Are you lost?


01:04:25.862 --> 01:04:28.384
Does your host family know that
you're alive?


01:04:31.749 --> 01:04:34.070
Does anyone know you're alive?


01:04:39.796 --> 01:04:41.517
You come with me.


01:04:41.918 --> 01:04:43.561
We will sort this out.


01:04:45.401 --> 01:04:49.327
And ever since then, I just knew what
I have to do to be strong.


01:04:49.567 --> 01:04:53.210
And when I'm full, like I'm right now.
I'm like...


01:04:53.690 --> 01:04:55.052
..unkillable.


01:04:55.171 --> 01:04:57.094
Like I can do shit like this.
Watch!


01:04:59.897 --> 01:05:01.939
It's really cool.
Just relax. Look.


01:05:05.664 --> 01:05:07.705
It's like some X-Men shit, right?


01:05:13.909 --> 01:05:17.035
What do you mean, when you're full?


01:05:20.237 --> 01:05:22.439
What about my mom's Kia?


01:05:22.719 --> 01:05:24.922
Why were you covered in blood?


01:05:25.042 --> 01:05:27.365
You didn't even look human.


01:05:30.007 --> 01:05:33.330
You know, Needy, maybe you should
talk to somebody about these...


01:05:33.410 --> 01:05:35.452
..disturbing thoughts.


01:05:35.532 --> 01:05:39.176
..that you're having.
We're all really concerned.


01:05:40.178 --> 01:05:42.099
Especially, Chip.


01:05:42.500 --> 01:05:45.023
I think he may be having
second thoughts about you.


01:05:45.102 --> 01:05:46.064
Leave!


01:05:46.224 --> 01:05:48.425
Come on, Needy.
Let me stay the night.


01:05:48.546 --> 01:05:51.789
We can play 'boyfriend/girlfriend'
like we used to.


01:06:06.205 --> 01:06:08.926
What are you doing?
- Um, you said to leave.


01:06:09.326 --> 01:06:11.250
See you at school.


01:06:35.554 --> 01:06:39.878
We're gathered here to celebrate
the life of Collin Gray.


01:06:40.439 --> 01:06:42.761
Who was plucked from the prime
of his youth.


01:06:54.052 --> 01:06:57.576
<i>They did a big memorial assembly
for Collin at school.</i>


01:06:58.457 --> 01:07:00.660
<i>And we had to watch another
presentation about curfews...</i>


01:07:00.739 --> 01:07:03.982
<i>..and the buddy system and
how to deal with grief.</i>


01:07:04.423 --> 01:07:06.746
<i>But nobody seemed to care anymore.</i>


01:07:07.346 --> 01:07:09.868
<i>Sorrow was last week's emotion.</i>


01:07:11.870 --> 01:07:14.714
<i>Sure we all hope this would be
the last funeral.</i>


01:07:15.033 --> 01:07:16.675
<i>But I knew better.</i>


01:07:17.317 --> 01:07:19.359
<i>So I did some research.</i>


01:07:19.879 --> 01:07:21.801
<i>Paranormal research.</i>


01:07:35.054 --> 01:07:37.377
<I>OFFERING A VIRGIN TO SATAN.


01:07:38.738 --> 01:07:43.462
..forever feed on flesh to...


01:07:43.903 --> 01:07:45.825
Destroying a demon.


01:07:46.145 --> 01:07:48.348
Demons are weakest when hungry.


01:07:48.427 --> 01:07:52.912
But a blade to the heart is the
surest way to kill the beast.


01:07:57.677 --> 01:08:01.601
<i>Jennifer and I hadn't spoken since
our encounter in my room.</i>


01:08:02.363 --> 01:08:05.085
<i>Actually, I hadn't really spoken to anyone.</i>


01:08:22.020 --> 01:08:23.544
Hey.


01:08:24.544 --> 01:08:26.467
I just bought our formal tickets.


01:08:26.546 --> 01:08:29.270
Did you make reservations at
the Cheesecake Factory?


01:08:30.670 --> 01:08:32.993
Chip, I can't go to the dance
with you.


01:08:33.073 --> 01:08:34.394
What? Why?


01:08:34.594 --> 01:08:36.117
Look, just trust me.


01:08:36.316 --> 01:08:37.838
You shouldn't go at all.


01:08:37.957 --> 01:08:40.560
What're you talking about?
- Not here.


01:08:40.760 --> 01:08:42.803
What's going on?
You're breaking up with me?


01:08:42.963 --> 01:08:44.884
Please, Chip.
I just need to tell you something.


01:08:45.085 --> 01:08:46.207
Is this about Jennifer?
- Yes.


01:08:46.288 --> 01:08:49.410
But I promise you this is the last time...
- Needy, I care about you.


01:08:49.490 --> 01:08:50.331
A lot.


01:08:50.411 --> 01:08:53.814
As a person, not just some girl
I made love to four minutes ago.


01:08:53.893 --> 01:08:56.095
And-And I'm scared of what's
happening to you.


01:08:56.255 --> 01:08:59.900
You're acting really fucked up.
- Please just let me show you.


01:09:02.663 --> 01:09:03.904
Okay.


01:09:03.985 --> 01:09:05.626
Jennifer's evil.


01:09:06.507 --> 01:09:07.749
I know.


01:09:07.949 --> 01:09:09.991
No, I mean, she's actually evil.


01:09:10.192 --> 01:09:11.713
Not high school evil.


01:09:11.792 --> 01:09:15.435
I've been through the occult section
of the library five times.


01:09:15.636 --> 01:09:17.557
Our library has a occult section?


01:09:17.677 --> 01:09:20.801
Yeah, its-its really small...


01:09:21.523 --> 01:09:23.164
You have to read this.


01:09:25.287 --> 01:09:26.848
Demon...
- Demonic transference.


01:09:26.928 --> 01:09:28.089
It's something that happens...


01:09:28.169 --> 01:09:30.211
..when you try to sacrifice
a virgin to Satan...


01:09:30.290 --> 01:09:31.933
..without using an actual virgin.


01:09:32.013 --> 01:09:33.134
The guys from the band...


01:09:33.214 --> 01:09:34.736
..tried to sacrifice her in the woods.


01:09:34.815 --> 01:09:35.656
But what they didn't know...


01:09:35.737 --> 01:09:37.738
..is that she hasn't been a virgin
since junior high.


01:09:37.818 --> 01:09:39.340
It all makes sense now.
Read this.


01:09:39.460 --> 01:09:41.183
If the human sacrifice is impure,


01:09:41.262 --> 01:09:42.384
..the result may still be obtained.


01:09:42.464 --> 01:09:44.667
But a demon will ever reside in the
soul of the victim.


01:09:44.746 --> 01:09:47.749
She must forever feed on flesh
to substain the demon.


01:09:48.070 --> 01:09:49.990
Okay.
- She's eating boys!


01:09:50.110 --> 01:09:51.632
They like make her really...


01:09:51.711 --> 01:09:52.834
..pretty and glowy...


01:09:52.913 --> 01:09:54.836
..and her hair looks amazing.


01:09:54.916 --> 01:09:57.959
And then when she's hungry,
she's weak and cranky and ugly.


01:09:58.040 --> 01:09:59.961
I mean like ugly for her.


01:10:00.521 --> 01:10:02.163
So, you get it?


01:10:02.324 --> 01:10:03.566
The dance.


01:10:03.886 --> 01:10:07.009
It'll be like an all-you-can-eat buffet.


01:10:09.771 --> 01:10:11.573
Needy, I think you need help.


01:10:11.693 --> 01:10:13.495
Oh, my God!
You don't beleive me.


01:10:13.575 --> 01:10:16.698
It's not that I don't believe you,
I just don't believe this.


01:10:16.779 --> 01:10:19.221
God, this is a nightmare.


01:10:21.783 --> 01:10:23.425
And what about the dance?


01:10:23.545 --> 01:10:26.788
Who cares about the goddamn dance, Chip?
- I do.


01:10:26.988 --> 01:10:29.190
I ordered your corsage,
it's an orchid.


01:10:29.271 --> 01:10:31.233
It was like $12.


01:10:34.395 --> 01:10:35.636
I'll be at the dance.


01:10:35.717 --> 01:10:37.640
I just need to keep an eye on Jennifer.


01:10:38.361 --> 01:10:40.562
Promise me, you're not gonna go.


01:10:43.567 --> 01:10:44.966
Needy, I...


01:10:45.047 --> 01:10:47.007
..I'm not your guy anymore?


01:10:47.088 --> 01:10:49.932
Chip, it's not safe for us to be
together right now.


