01:12:08.452 --> 01:12:10.774
You picking Needy up at her house?


01:12:13.137 --> 01:12:15.979
I'm-I'm meeting her at the dance.


01:12:16.220 --> 01:12:18.582
I want pictures with your sister
before you go.


01:12:18.662 --> 01:12:20.183
Yes, ma'am.


01:12:22.345 --> 01:12:24.268
<I>"New Perspective"
performed by Panic at the Disco


01:12:24.948 --> 01:12:27.151
<i>Stop there and let me correct it.</i>


01:12:27.232 --> 01:12:30.354
<i>I wanna live a life from a new perspective.</i>


01:12:30.434 --> 01:12:33.277
<i>You come along because I love your face.</i>


01:12:33.358 --> 01:12:36.039
<i>And I'll admire your expensive taste.</i>


01:12:36.119 --> 01:12:38.563
<i>And who cares divine intervention.</i>


01:12:38.642 --> 01:12:41.125
<i>I wanna be praised from a new perspective.</i>


01:12:41.205 --> 01:12:41.926
Okay, one more.


01:12:42.006 --> 01:12:43.247
Back to back.


01:12:44.047 --> 01:12:45.690
Big smiles.


01:12:45.769 --> 01:12:47.412
Chees-s-s-e.


01:13:30.574 --> 01:13:32.095
<I>"Death"
performed by White Lies


01:13:32.336 --> 01:13:35.580
<i>I wonder what keeps us so high up.</i>


01:13:39.544 --> 01:13:43.067
<i>Could there be a love beneath these wings.</i>


01:13:46.111 --> 01:13:49.633
<i>If we suddenly fall should I scream out?</i>


01:13:52.997 --> 01:13:56.922
<i>Keep very quiet and cling to
my mouth as I'm crying.</i>


01:13:57.002 --> 01:13:58.723
<i>So frightened of dying,</i>


01:13:58.805 --> 01:14:00.446
<i>Relax, yes, I'm trying,</i>


01:14:00.605 --> 01:14:04.410
<i>But fears got a hold on me.</i>


01:14:06.932 --> 01:14:09.934
<i>Yes, this fears got a hold on me.</i>


01:14:10.255 --> 01:14:11.777
Here, we all are...


01:14:14.219 --> 01:14:16.260
Quiet-Quiet now, please.


01:14:17.302 --> 01:14:18.464
Boys?


01:14:18.585 --> 01:14:19.865
Thank you.


01:14:19.946 --> 01:14:20.946
Welcome...


01:14:21.027 --> 01:14:22.949
..to the Spring Prom.


01:14:34.720 --> 01:14:36.241
Chip!


01:14:38.564 --> 01:14:40.767
Didn't you hear me calling your name?


01:14:40.967 --> 01:14:42.888
You weren't calling my name.


01:14:43.210 --> 01:14:44.730
Yes, I was.


01:14:45.971 --> 01:14:47.492
I-I couldn't hear it.


01:14:47.572 --> 01:14:51.096
Listen, I need to talk to you
about you-know-who.


01:14:52.018 --> 01:14:53.540
Our little Needy.


01:14:53.779 --> 01:14:57.103
I hope everybody had enough
opportunity to consume some of the...


01:14:57.183 --> 01:14:58.304
..Pecan Sandies...


01:14:58.385 --> 01:14:59.505
..and Cran-Grape...


01:14:59.586 --> 01:15:02.708
..that was so generously donated
by the Parents Club.


01:15:04.711 --> 01:15:07.433
But the real treat is yet to come.


01:15:07.594 --> 01:15:11.517
She's been acting a little off lately.


01:15:13.720 --> 01:15:15.362
Look,


01:15:16.083 --> 01:15:18.285
I think I know what's wrong with her.


01:15:18.605 --> 01:15:20.126
What?
What is it?


01:15:20.686 --> 01:15:24.732
You know, how Needy has been
really upset since Collin Gray died?


01:15:25.172 --> 01:15:27.094
Well, it's not just because he was like...


01:15:27.174 --> 01:15:29.495
..brutally murdered and stuff.


01:15:30.136 --> 01:15:32.738
I don't wanna say this.
- Say it!


01:15:35.101 --> 01:15:37.144
Needy and Collin were intimate.


01:15:38.906 --> 01:15:40.026
And by that...


01:15:40.106 --> 01:15:43.349
..I mean they were poking on a
semi-regular basis.


01:15:44.510 --> 01:15:45.472
No...


01:15:45.632 --> 01:15:49.436
She and Collin were doing things that
you have never even heard of.


01:15:49.516 --> 01:15:51.558
Okay, total varsity moves.


01:15:54.321 --> 01:15:57.845
I just can't believe that she would mess
with your head like this.


01:15:58.845 --> 01:16:02.370
I care about you so much, Chip.


01:16:05.372 --> 01:16:08.095
More than I've ever had the guts to admit.


01:16:10.418 --> 01:16:12.019
These fine, young gentlemen,


01:16:12.099 --> 01:16:14.341
..have been generous enough to
take time out...


01:16:14.422 --> 01:16:18.344
..from their sold-out national tour.


01:16:18.745 --> 01:16:21.869
To play our dance. For free.


01:16:24.472 --> 01:16:26.914
Needy didn't deserve a boy like you.


01:16:27.955 --> 01:16:29.196
Boys and girls,


01:16:29.677 --> 01:16:30.918
..please welcome...


01:16:31.117 --> 01:16:33.321
..L-o-o-o-w Shoulder!


01:17:01.188 --> 01:17:02.709
<I>"Through The Trees"
performed by Low Shoulder


01:17:03.031 --> 01:17:05.794
<i>All alone in an empty room,</i>


01:17:06.355 --> 01:17:10.679
<i>Nothing left but the memories of when...</i>


01:17:11.319 --> 01:17:13.361
<i>..I had my best friend.</i>


01:17:13.441 --> 01:17:15.362
Oh, you're so salty!


01:17:16.204 --> 01:17:18.127
Yeah! You're...


01:17:18.246 --> 01:17:19.287
..salty too.


01:17:19.368 --> 01:17:21.289
Say it like you mean it.


01:17:21.930 --> 01:17:25.052
Say I'm better than Needy.
- What? Why?


01:17:26.494 --> 01:17:33.020
<i>Take my breath as your own.</i>


01:17:33.101 --> 01:17:39.668
<i>Take my eyes to guide you home.</i>


