<i>I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:17:47.155 --> 01:17:50.399
<i>I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:17:50.800 --> 01:17:53.722
<i>I'm still here...</i>


01:17:54.042 --> 01:17:55.003
Chip!


01:17:55.244 --> 01:17:58.767
<i>Because I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:17:58.887 --> 01:18:02.212
<i>I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:18:02.291 --> 01:18:05.535
<i>I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:18:05.614 --> 01:18:09.137
<i>And I'm still here so...</i>


01:18:09.217 --> 01:18:12.421
<i>Because I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:18:12.622 --> 01:18:15.864
<i>I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:18:15.945 --> 01:18:19.188
<i>I'm still here breathing now.</i>


01:18:19.668 --> 01:18:22.793
<i>And I'm still here...</i>


01:18:22.992 --> 01:18:26.115
<i>Because you're not coming back.</i>


01:18:49.778 --> 01:18:52.221
What are you doing?
- Swimming.


01:18:54.583 --> 01:18:56.225
Come on, Chip.


01:18:56.347 --> 01:18:58.669
Show me your breast stroke.


01:19:12.683 --> 01:19:14.724
I feel so empty.


01:19:19.330 --> 01:19:21.250
Yeah, me too.


01:19:23.573 --> 01:19:26.295
Please just come here and kiss me again.


01:19:36.386 --> 01:19:37.909
I can't.


01:19:39.150 --> 01:19:40.791
I'm sorry.


01:19:41.231 --> 01:19:43.154
This just feels weird.


01:20:21.592 --> 01:20:23.514
Help!


01:20:50.062 --> 01:20:51.703
Needy.


01:21:20.093 --> 01:21:21.734
Needy.


01:21:45.678 --> 01:21:47.199
She can fly?


01:21:47.640 --> 01:21:48.881
She's just hovering.


01:21:48.961 --> 01:21:49.841
It's not that impressive.


01:21:50.202 --> 01:21:53.406
God, do you have to undermine
everything that I do?


01:21:53.566 --> 01:21:55.768
You're such a player-hater.


01:21:56.088 --> 01:21:57.609
You're a jerk.


01:21:57.649 --> 01:22:00.413
Wow! Nice insult, Hannah Montana!


01:22:00.573 --> 01:22:01.934
You got any more harsh digs?


01:22:02.014 --> 01:22:03.696
You know what?


01:22:03.815 --> 01:22:05.859
You were never a good friend.


01:22:05.939 --> 01:22:08.780
Even when we were little.
You used to steal my toys...


01:22:08.860 --> 01:22:12.784
..pour lemonade on my bed.
- And now I'm eating your boyfriend!


01:22:12.864 --> 01:22:15.187
See, atleast I'm consistent.


01:22:15.307 --> 01:22:18.151
Why do you need him? Huh?


01:22:18.471 --> 01:22:20.994
You could have anybody,
you think want, Jennifer.


01:22:21.073 --> 01:22:23.756
So..why Chip?


01:22:23.836 --> 01:22:26.158
Is it just to piss me off?


01:22:26.239 --> 01:22:29.762
Or is it because you're just really insecure?


01:22:30.603 --> 01:22:32.525
I'm not insecure, Needy.


